flowchart TD
    A([Start handleNewMessages])

    A --> B{{For Each Telegram Message}}

    B --> C[Read chat_id and text]

    C --> D[Print Diagnostic Message]

    D --> E{Command Received?}

    E -->|/start /help ?| F[command_help]
    E -->|/status| G[command_status]
    E -->|/rom| H[command_rom]
    E -->|/ota| I[command_ota]
    E -->|/debug-on| J[command_debug_on]
    E -->|/debug-off| K[command_debug_off]
    E -->|/WDT-on| L[command_WDT_on]
    E -->|/WDT-off| M[command_WDT_off]
    E -->|/_UPDATE| N[command_update]
    E -->|/_RESET| O[command_reset]
    E -->|/superhelp| P[command_superhelp]
    E -->|Other| Q[No Action]

    F --> R{More Messages?}
    G --> R
    H --> R
    I --> R
    J --> R
    K --> R
    L --> R
    M --> R
    N --> R
    O --> R
    P --> R
    Q --> R

    R -- Yes --> B
    R -- No --> S([Return])
